{"id":"n26148-1-9","stage":0,"title":"아빠 · 爸爸","scene":"生活与经历","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n26148-1-9-1","ko":"아빠, 안녕히 다녀오세요.","zh":"爸爸，您出门路上注意安全。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"아빠,","meaning":"爸爸","explanation":"아빠：爸爸","readings":[{"term":"아빠","audio":"/audio/c9f209994786f50d1897.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26148","senseId":"1","lemma":"아빠","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"안녕히","meaning":"平安地，安宁地","explanation":"안녕히：平安地，安宁地","readings":[{"term":"안녕히","audio":"/audio/d374b281ed77391de709.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"28415","senseId":"1","lemma":"안녕히","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"다녀오세요.","meaning":"去一趟，去了趟","explanation":"다녀오다：去一趟，去了趟；세요：包含尊敬形式的礼貌句末，可表示请求、劝告或询问等。","readings":[{"term":"다녀오다","audio":"/audio/09b8a3cf21a41c7a72ed.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64529","senseId":"1","lemma":"다녀오다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"c9f209994786f50d","term":"아빠","zh":"爸爸","audio":"/audio/c9f209994786f50d1897.mp3","entryId":"26148","definition":"在非正式场合用于指称或称呼父亲。","pronunciation":["아빠"]},{"id":"d374b281ed77391d","term":"안녕히","zh":"平安地，安宁地","audio":"/audio/d374b281ed77391de709.mp3","entryId":"28415","definition":"没有任何问题或担忧而舒适地。","pronunciation":["안녕히"]},{"id":"09b8a3cf21a41c7a","term":"다녀오다","zh":"去一趟，去了趟","audio":"/audio/09b8a3cf21a41c7a72ed.mp3","entryId":"64529","definition":"去某地后又回来。","pronunciation":["다녀오다"]}],"audio":"/audio/94f07d7fcee3a6e8403b.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n26148-1-9-2","ko":"그래 엄마 말씀 잘 듣고 오늘도 공부 열심히 해라.","zh":"好的，要听妈妈的话，今天也要好好学习哦。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"그래","meaning":"好吧，是","explanation":"그래：好吧，是","readings":[{"term":"그래","audio":"/audio/d39087dda3899d88b99b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27656","senseId":"1","lemma":"그래","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"엄마","meaning":"妈妈","explanation":"엄마：妈妈","readings":[{"term":"엄마","audio":"/audio/9498f9014908e2891f1f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":